// Savina Philosophers (arbitrator variant, 18 meals each), DSL arm, backend=Stub. Generated by savina/build.py.
team Philosopher1[agent : Stub]
{
    input grant : string
    output done : string

    // @title Eat one meal
    // @desc Runs only while the arbitrator has given this philosopher both of its forks.
    task agent(grant) -> done """
        You are philosopher 1 of 5 at a round table. You use fork 1 on your left and fork 2 on your right; philosophers 5 and 2 share them with you. You eat 18 meals, one at a time, and you may eat only while you hold both of your forks.

        The arbitrator has given you both of your forks for this meal; they go back when you answer. Do the meal below and set `done` to the answer only.

        $(grant)
    """
}

